OL,3,GNEWSAWorking in the funeral sector
OL,4,Ataught me about life, says gravedigger
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I learnt more in the mortuary than I
OL,7,Fdid through all of my education.
OL,9,F"I learnt about the real world, how
OL,10,Fpeople work, how grief is processed,
OL,11,Fwhat happens after death - and I
OL,12,Fabsolutely loved it."
OL,14,FGravedigger Louis Fensome has worked in
OL,15,Fthe funeral sector since the age of 17,
OL,16,Fand has now been shortlisted for a
OL,17,Fmajor industry award.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
