OL,3,GNEWSAWorking in the funeral sector
OL,4,Ataught me about life, says gravedigger
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 27-year-old set up his own business
OL,7,Fsix years ago, and is one of four
OL,8,Ffinalists in the Gravedigger of the
OL,9,FYear category at the Good Funeral
OL,10,FAwards, praised for his "precision and
OL,11,Fattention to detail".
